## Why Asked
Tests understanding of Kubernetes architecture and container orchestration fundamentals.

## Key Concepts
- Plugin architecture for container runtimes
- Kubelet communication layer
- Runtime-agnostic design
- Pluggable container runtime support

## Code Example
```
// CRI runtime service interface
service RuntimeService {
    // Create a new container
    CreateContainer(CreateContainerRequest) returns (CreateContainerResponse)

    // Start a container
    StartContainer(StartContainerRequest) returns (StartContainerResponse)

    // Stop a container
    StopContainer(StopContainerRequest) returns (StopContainerResponse)
}```
